## First section

Write the milestone here in Markdown. Every "## " heading becomes a numbered
section and an entry in the side index. See 01-inception.md for the ready-made
blocks (personas, goals, MVP, state-of-the-art table, architecture, timeline).

Optional fields: code (big badge, e.g. M2), slides (Canva: Share → More → Embed,
copy the link from src="..."), pdf (put the file in public/milestones/),
link (any related link), image (card picture).

To publish this milestone for real:
1. Duplicate this file next to it.
2. Rename it to something like `milestone-1.md` (the file name becomes the page's URL: /milestones/milestone-1).
3. Fill in the fields above and the text below.
4. Delete the `.example` extension is not needed — just make sure the real file ends in `.md`, not `.md.example`.
